# GetNextSPL — pick-loop entry point. PEEK ONLY (does not modify storage
# state, mirrors GetSPL semantics — see SPECS doc Decisions Log #8/#10).
#
# Returns the first occupied slot whose SPL state matches the requested
# state, scanned in a statically configured ascending/descending slot-index
# order (~ascending_order param on the node — see SPECS doc Decisions Log
# #10). This is NOT a live TF/geometry query: "closest to the robot" is
# just launch-time configuration of which end of the slot range to scan
# from first, mirroring the reference repo's `get_minitray_order` pattern.

string state
---
storage_system/SPL spl
int32 slot
bool found
storage_system/Result result
